                        "recommendationid": "238767271",
                        "author": {
                            "steamid": "76561198122169688",
                            "num_reviews": 43,
                            "playtime_forever": 113,
                            "playtime_last_two_weeks": 113,
                            "playtime_at_review": 113,
                            "last_played": 1793215326
                        },
                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "This game is fine. Extremely easy puzzles with extremely tedious back and forth in rooms for objects. Some \"tasks\" are stupid, like having to get a box to put toys in so you can get to the chest underneath? Just throw the toys on the floor! \nVoice acting is very bad. Also, some language barriers exist in the translation. In one hidden object mini-game, you have to find a \"troll\" and the object is fish bait. \nI say if it is  on sale give it a go, it'll be an easy breezy game to pass the time. I recommend because it wasn't a dogshit game, just not the best.\n\n2 out of 5 stars for story\n2 out of 5 stars for gameplay\n4 out of 5 stars for art design",
